###### Debian 12 (Bookworm) Build Instruction ########
1. cd kmailio (parent directory of `src` directory
2. make cfg include_modules="presence"
3. make modules
4. cd src/modules/presence
5. git add -f presence.so
6. git commmit -m "presence.so" module with bugfix
7. cp presence.so /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/kamailio/modules/.
